  <ol class="how-steps">
    <li>
      <strong>A data centre wants to build in BC.</strong> It asks BC Hydro for power. BC Hydro got 15 applications in 2026.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>It brings more new power than it uses.</strong> It pays for new clean power and the lines to carry it, more than it needs itself. Ireland now makes new data centres bring their own generation or storage, enough to match the most power they can draw from the grid. <span class="srcs"><a href="https://www.cru.ie/about-us/news/the-cru-publishes-its-decision-on-new-electricity-connection-policy-for-data-centres/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CRU, Ireland’s regulator, Dec 2025</a></span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Everyone gets a bigger grid.</strong> The extra power serves homes and businesses across BC.
    </li>
  </ol>
